{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the Snow with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/8df1b12add94e1facdbd8fc1c3082e5d.poster.avif?t=1770750616\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/8df1b12add94e1facdbd8fc1c3082e5d.webm?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/8df1b12add94e1facdbd8fc1c3082e5d.mp4?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From casual players to perfectionists \u2014 everyone will find something for themselves. Enjoy the calm rhythm, cozy atmosphere, and meditative satisfaction of clearing snow one patch at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have Fun with up to 4 Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/9a64f57580da32fd92b683e7daee9c12.poster.avif?t=1770750616\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/9a64f57580da32fd92b683e7daee9c12.webm?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/9a64f57580da32fd92b683e7daee9c12.mp4?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shovel isn\u2019t just a tool \u2014 it\u2019s also a ride!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide down snowy hills with your friends and prove who\u2019s the fastest to reach the bottom. Have snowball fights, build snowmen, and take on fun challenges \u2014 there\u2019s always something to do together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose the Right Tool and Enjoy the Process</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/77e6badcb7d210583352bfb71ce75a08.poster.avif?t=1770750616\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/77e6badcb7d210583352bfb71ce75a08.webm?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/77e6badcb7d210583352bfb71ce75a08.mp4?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as every movement reveals a perfectly clean surface beneath. Layer by layer, the heavy snow disappears, leaving behind a sense of order and peace. It\u2019s more than just cleaning \u2014 it\u2019s a mesmerizing, soothing experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Powerful Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/1b3ca07046ace0d0f1e0d08ae60c86b8.poster.avif?t=1770750616\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/1b3ca07046ace0d0f1e0d08ae60c86b8.webm?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/1b3ca07046ace0d0f1e0d08ae60c86b8.mp4?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have access to shovels, snow blowers, melting trucks, anti-ice chemicals, and even heavy machinery! Each tool you use earns experience points you can spend on upgrades and skill improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the Snow and Earn Money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/7d4be26cccd761668eb82e264cc68482.poster.avif?t=1770750616\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/7d4be26cccd761668eb82e264cc68482.webm?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/7d4be26cccd761668eb82e264cc68482.mp4?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple tools and take on snow-clearing jobs around town. Complete tasks, earn money, and gradually improve your equipment. As you progress, unlock new machines, access larger contracts, and expand your snow-removal capabilities step by step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist and Follow for Updates!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601810?t=1770750616","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601810?t=1770750616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/12fa92766d16c57a22c3347270e9eb3a5b3ef036/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770750616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/12fa92766d16c57a22c3347270e9eb3a5b3ef036/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770750616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the Snow with Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_p