</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/77e6badcb7d210583352bfb71ce75a08.poster.avif?t=1770750616\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/77e6badcb7d210583352bfb71ce75a08.webm?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/77e6badcb7d210583352bfb71ce75a08.mp4?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as every movement reveals a perfectly clean surface beneath. Layer by layer, the heavy snow disappears, leaving behind a sense of order and peace. It\u2019s more than just cleaning \u2014 it\u2019s a mesmerizing, soothing experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Powerful Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/1b3ca07046ace0d0f1e0d08ae60c86b8.poster.avif?t=1770750616\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/1b3ca07046ace0d0f1e0d08ae60c86b8.webm?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/1b3ca07046ace0d0f1e0d08ae60c86b8.mp4?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have access to shovels, snow blowers, melting trucks, anti-ice chemicals, and even heavy machinery! Each tool you use earns experience points you can spend on upgrades and skill improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the Snow and Earn Money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/7d4be26cccd761668eb82e264cc68482.poster.avif?t=1770750616\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/7d4be26cccd761668eb82e264cc68482.webm?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/extras/7d4be26cccd761668eb82e264cc68482.mp4?t=1770750616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with simple tools and take on snow-clearing jobs around town. Complete tasks, earn money, and gradually improve your equipment. As you progress, unlock new machines, access larger contracts, and expand your snow-removal capabilities step by step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist and Follow for Updates!</strong></h2>","developers":["Garden of Dreams"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601810/b6f351e2e0ccc64f877e2561708f6bb125a0fe1b/header.jpg?t=1770750616","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3601810/856249678/272f7c8d57596a740d5eaaf062f558521bd986a8/1762706820/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762743656","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3601810/856249678/272f7c8d57596a740d5eaaf062f558521bd986a8/1762706820/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762743656","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3601810/856249678/272f7c8d57596a740d5eaaf062f558521bd986a8/1762706820/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762743656","id":257228805,"name":"Trailer \u0421lear the Snow","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset